msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/observedFeature|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The individual whose property or state is being observed — the feature of interest. The range is intentionally open (logic:Thing — the OWL/RDFS projection renders it as the W3C OWL Thing top type) because anything can be observed: a place, a person, an event, a document, a quality value, or a situation. SHACL shapes enforce closed-world constraints per observation kind."
msgstr "其属性或状态正被观察的个体——即关注的特征。其值域被有意保持开放（logic:Thing——OWL/RDFS 投影将其呈现为 W3C OWL Thing 顶类型），因为任何事物都可被观察：一个地点、一个人、一个事件、一份文档、一个质量值或一种情形。SHACL 形状按观察种类施行闭世界约束。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/vantage|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "gmeow:vantage ⊑ gmeow:accordingTo: the reified relator edge is semantically subsumed by the annotation-property axis. This is NOT asserted as rdfs:subPropertyOf because gmeow:accordingTo is authored as a logic:AnnotationProperty (its generated OWL/RDFS projection is the W3C OWL AnnotationProperty) while vantage is a logic:ObjectProperty — keeping the OWL 2 DL downcast clean on that projection, Principle 3. The subsumption is documented here and realised in the projection layer, not axiomatised in the reasoned core."
msgstr "gmeow:vantage ⊑ gmeow:accordingTo：具体化关系边在语义上被注解属性轴所包含。这并未被断言为 rdfs:subPropertyOf，因为 gmeow:accordingTo 被写作 logic:AnnotationProperty（其生成的 OWL/RDFS 投影是 W3C OWL AnnotationProperty），而 vantage 是 logic:ObjectProperty——从而在该投影上保持 OWL 2 DL 下转的洁净，原则 3。该包含关系在此处被记录并在投影层实现，而非在被推理的核心中公理化。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Refinement"
msgstr "细化观测"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "An observation made by a named, versioned process reading another record, with that record as observed feature and the process as vantage. Results are new readings, never edits to the source."
msgstr "由具名且有版本的过程读取另一记录而形成的观测；被读记录是观测对象，该过程是观测视角。结果是新的解读，而非对来源的修改。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:reading a gmeow:Refinement ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:record ; gmeow:vantage ex:refinerV2 ."
msgstr "ex:reading a gmeow:Refinement ; gmeow:observedFeature ex:record ; gmeow:vantage ex:refinerV2 ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A process reading, not world determinacy, evidential support or a formal linguistic denotation. Different process versions and vantages retain separate records."
msgstr "这是过程的解读，并非世界的确定性、证据支持或形式语言指称。不同过程版本和视角保留各自的记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid mutating the source or treating a selected reading as an automatically asserted source fact."
msgstr "不要修改来源，也不要将选定解读自动当作来源事实来断言。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Name the source and versioned vantage, record refinementOutcome, and put selected individuals or derived observations in observationResult. Keep unselected alternatives in refinementCandidate."
msgstr "标明来源和有版本的视角，记录 refinementOutcome，并把选定个体或派生观测放入 observationResult。未选候选保留在 refinementCandidate 中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/Refinement|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for record interpretation such as mention resolution, time joins or narrative readings performed after the source was recorded."
msgstr "用于来源记录形成之后进行的提及消解、时间关联或叙事解读等记录解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "Refinement Outcome"
msgstr "细化结果"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The qualitative outcome of a process reading: resolved, best guess, ambiguous or unresolved. This axis describes the reading rather than the truth of its subject."
msgstr "过程解读的定性结果：已确定、暂定最佳、存在歧义或未能解读。该维度描述解读，而非其对象的真值。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "gmeow:refinementAmbiguous a gmeow:RefinementOutcome ."
msgstr "gmeow:refinementAmbiguous a gmeow:RefinementOutcome ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Outcome values are individuals, not subclasses, and are distinct from Determinacy and SupportStatus. The four supplied values do not assign a numeric probability."
msgstr "结果值是个体而非子类，且不同于 Determinacy 和 SupportStatus。提供的四个值不指定任何数值概率。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using a reading outcome as a truth value or a calibrated confidence score."
msgstr "不要将解读结果用作真值或经校准的置信分数。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Select an outcome individual through refinementOutcome on the corresponding Refinement."
msgstr "通过 refinementOutcome 将结果个体关联到相应 Refinement。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/RefinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use to distinguish how far a recorded interpretation progressed."
msgstr "用于区分记录中的解释进行到了哪一步。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "refinement outcome"
msgstr "细化结果关系"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a refinement to the qualitative outcome of its reading. Nonfunctional so coexisting attributed outcomes are retained."
msgstr "将细化观测关联到其解读的定性结果。关系非函数性，以保留并存的不同归属结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:reading gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."
msgstr "ex:reading gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "This reports the process outcome, not the evidence grade of a claim. A distinct process version should have a distinct refinement record."
msgstr "它记录过程结果，而非陈述的证据等级。不同过程版本应具有各自的细化观测记录。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid deriving a default outcome from missing data or silently choosing between competing attributions."
msgstr "不要从数据缺失推导默认结果，也不要暗中挑选相互竞争的归属。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Attach the explicit outcome value and preserve the vantage that attributed it."
msgstr "附上明确的结果值，并保留作出该归属的视角。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementOutcome|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when recall must distinguish a resolved reading from a guess, ambiguity or failure to resolve."
msgstr "当检索需要区分确定解读、猜测、歧义或未能消解时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "refinement candidate"
msgstr "细化候选"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "Relates a refinement to an unselected candidate reading or referent. Naming a candidate neither selects it as a result nor asserts the statement it reifies."
msgstr "将细化观测关联到尚未选定的候选解读或指称对象。命名候选既不将其选为结果，也不断言其所具体化的语句。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:ambiguous gmeow:refinementCandidate ex:readingA, ex:readingB ."
msgstr "ex:ambiguous gmeow:refinementCandidate ex:readingA, ex:readingB ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Nonfunctional and deliberately not a subproperty of observationResult or candidateHypothesis. The latter belongs to an InferenceCommitment, not a generic process reading."
msgstr "该关系非函数性，且有意不作为 observationResult 或 candidateHypothesis 的子属性。后者属于 InferenceCommitment，而非一般过程解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid asserting all candidate contents or treating candidate existence as a selected answer."
msgstr "不要断言所有候选内容，也不要把候选的存在当成选定答案。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Reference each alternative from the refinement; if it is propositional, use RDF 1.2 reification without asserting its quoted content."
msgstr "从细化观测指向每个备选；若候选是命题，使用 RDF 1.2 具体化且不断言其中引用的内容。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementCandidate|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use for ambiguous or otherwise unselected reading alternatives that must remain queryable."
msgstr "用于需要保留可查询性的歧义候选或其他未选解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "resolved reading"
msgstr "已确定解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process selected one reading with adequate confidence for its declared task."
msgstr "过程以足够满足其声明任务的信心选定了一个解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementResolved ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementResolved ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Resolution belongs to this process and source scope; it is not a guarantee of world truth or universal agreement."
msgstr "确定性属于该过程及来源作用域，不保证世界真值或普遍共识。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid using resolved status to erase another vantage or bypass source provenance."
msgstr "不要借已确定状态抹去其他视角或绕过来源信息。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Record the selected target or derived observation through observationResult."
msgstr "通过 observationResult 记录选定目标或派生观测。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementResolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when one sufficiently supported reading was selected."
msgstr "当选定了一个得到足够支持的解读时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "best-guess reading"
msgstr "暂定最佳解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process provisionally selected one reading without the confidence required for resolved status."
msgstr "过程暂时选定一个解读，但其信心尚不足以使用已确定状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementBestGuess ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "A qualitative provisional selection, not a prescribed credence number or a claim of certainty."
msgstr "这是定性的暂时选择，并非指定的信念度数值或确定性宣称。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a numeric probability from this value or presenting the answer without its provisional status."
msgstr "不要从该值编造数值概率，也不要隐去答案的暂定状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Keep the selected result and expose the best-guess outcome to consumers that hedge or request confirmation."
msgstr "保留选定结果，并向需要保留余地或请求确认的使用方暴露暂定最佳状态。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementBestGuess|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when one reading is useful but remains a guess."
msgstr "当某个解读有用但仍属猜测时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "ambiguous reading"
msgstr "歧义解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process retained several candidate readings without selecting one."
msgstr "过程保留多个候选解读，尚未选定其中一个。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementAmbiguous ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementAmbiguous ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "Candidate multiplicity is explicit and is not resolved by graph order, label matching or a privileged vantage."
msgstr "候选的多重性是明确的；不能通过图顺序、标签匹配或特权视角自动消解。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid copying every candidate into selected results."
msgstr "不要把每个候选都复制到选定结果中。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "List alternatives with refinementCandidate and leave a selected result absent until a reading is actually chosen."
msgstr "用 refinementCandidate 列出备选；在实际选定解读之前不填写选定结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementAmbiguous|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when several readings remain and recall should ask which was meant."
msgstr "当多个解读仍然并存，检索应询问所指为何时使用。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label"
msgid "unresolved reading"
msgstr "未能解读"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition"
msgid "The process produced no reading in the recorded source and task scope."
msgstr "过程在所记录的来源和任务作用域内未产生解读。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#example"
msgid "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementUnresolved ."
msgstr "ex:r gmeow:refinementOutcome gmeow:refinementUnresolved ."

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#scopeNote"
msgid "An explicit process outcome, not missing data and not proof that no interpretation exists."
msgstr "这是明确的过程结果，不是数据缺失，也不证明不存在任何解释。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/avoidWhen"
msgid "Avoid inventing a result node merely to fill an unresolved record."
msgstr "不要仅为填满未能解读的记录而捏造结果节点。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/howToUse"
msgid "Retain source and versioned vantage, record this outcome and omit a selected result."
msgstr "保留来源和有版本的视角，记录该结果，并不填写选定结果。"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/refinementUnresolved|https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/useWhen"
msgid "Use when a completed reading attempt found no interpretation."
msgstr "当一次已完成的解读尝试未找到解释时使用。"
